  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Simplify ${csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -{cot}^{4}\u2061\\theta -2{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta .$",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta ={csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -{cot}^{4}\u2061\\theta -2{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta  & ={csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -{({cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta )}^{2}-2{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -({csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -1)^{2}-2({csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -1) \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -({csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -2{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta +1)-2{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta +2 \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta -{csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta +2{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -1-2{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta +2 \\\\  & =\\cancel{{csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta }-\\cancel{{csc}^{4}\u2061\\theta }+\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta }-1-\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta }+2 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
